Hi monks!<br>

I am trying unsuccessfully to remove the duplicates from this array. All values are still showing in the Dump<br>
Is there a better way to do this?<br> I wish I could to this without having to add the new values to a new variable.<br>
Here is my test code:<br>

<code>
#!/usr/bin/perl

use strict;
use warnings;
